<title>USA: South Bound Brook, N.J., won by Janney. [CORRECTED 17:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>South Bound Brook, N.J., won by Janney. [CORRECTED 17:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner of bonds in headline and text from Prudential. Also corrects low rate and high price.)</p>
<p>Janney Montgomery Scott said it won $1.04 million of South Bound Brook, N.J., various general obligation bonds, with a low rate of 4.80, high price of 100.0236.</p>
</text>
